# --- Secrets / service-account credentials (NEVER commit) ---
# Patterns are GLOBBED, not exact: `**/coiled-data.json` did NOT match
# `coiled-data-e4drr_202505.json`, which sat untracked-but-unignored in
# ecmwf/icechunk-par/ -- one `git add .` from being published.
**/service_account/*.json
**/coiled-data*.json
**/*-key.json
*-deployer-key.json
gcp-*-key.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*-sa.json
# .env files (HF tokens etc.)
.env
**/.env

# --- Mirror / run logs (source.coop publish artifacts) ---
icechunk-dask/*.log
**/mirror_*.log

# --- Notebook / tooling noise ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# secrets
.env
coiled-data.json
**/coiled-data.json

# Session transcripts and conversation exports -- working notes, never
# committed. The pattern below covers every file the seven per-file entries
# here used to list, plus /export output and nohup captures, wherever they
# land. Deliberately NOT a blanket *.txt: gfs/requirements.txt is a real file,
# and so is the benchmark output under */results/ that the docs cite by name.
# Verify any change to this with `git check-ignore -v` against one of those.
20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]*.txt
untitled*.txt
Untitled*.txt
docs/
cfs/cfs_template/
cfs/cfs_validation/*.parquet
cfs/cfs_ensemble_202602/
